# Title: PowerShell Script Change Permission Via Set-Acl
# ID: bdeb2cff-af74-4094-8426-724dc937f20a
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2022-10-18
# Tags: attack.stealth
# Description: Detects PowerShell execution to set the ACL of a file or a folder
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((cmdline:*Set-Acl * AND cmdline:*-AclObject * AND cmdline:*-Path *)) AND (((OriginalFileName:"PowerShell.EXE" OR OriginalFileName:"pwsh.dll")) OR ((process_name:*\\powershell.exe OR process_name:*\\pwsh.exe))))
